    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01787",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "植村用几乎听不见的声音又说：“这是什么意思。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In a voice that was almost inaudible, Uemura said again, \"What does this mean?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
